# Production environment variables.
#
# Set the ACTUAL values in your Vercel project (Settings -> Environment
# Variables), not here. Vercel injects them into the runtime automatically.
# This file only documents which variables the app expects.
#
# NOTE: do NOT use `VAR=${VAR}` passthrough lines here — dotenv-expand recurses
# on self-references and fails to load the whole file ("Maximum call stack size
# exceeded"), which silently drops every variable.
#
# Required:
#   NEWSDATA_API_KEY              Server-side NewsData.io key (used by /api/news)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_NEWSDATA_API_KEY  Legacy/public NewsData.io key (fallback)
#   GOOGLE_API_KEY               Server-side Google Gemini key (used by /api/ai)
#
# Optional:
#   GEMINI_MODEL                 Override the Gemini model (default: gemini-2.5-flash)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_API_KEY   Legacy public Gemini key; only used if GOOGLE_API_KEY
#                                is unset. Prefer GOOGLE_API_KEY so the key is never
#                                shipped to the browser.
